Homeland Security Grant Award
Agenda Notes.
10.08.13
The original award for monies tobe set aside for security camera(s)in downtown camein
the form of a letter from the office of Homeland Security.A subsequent internal inspection
conducted byH.S.found aletter tobe insufficient notification.This H.S.internal audit
recommended that thelocal H.S.office retroactively complete a standard grant application/award
process. This agenda item will rectify that circumstance thus allowing for the reimbursement of
funds to the City.So, in conclusion, this actionwill help Homeland Security witha bit ofinternal
housekeeping.Please call mewith any questions you might have.
Thank you.
Bob Bradshaw
Project Director
```

